// Aster experimentals (tech 4): too big for any factory. Combat engineers raise them on a
// lot of their own, as they would a structure (`footprint` on a mobile unit), and the
// finished machine drives off it.
[
    (
        // A super-heavy assault tank built round the AEB-2, the electric bore scaled up
        // until it no longer aims well: the tracer strays, and the charge sears everything
        // along its channel on the way down, leaving the ground molten behind it. Sponson
        // compact AEB turrets for what gets close, a shatter gun on the rear deck, and a hull
        // field over all of it.
